# Sun-Blessed Healer: "Kicker {1}{W}. When this creature enters, if it was kicked, return target nonland permanent card with mana
# value 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield." On turn 1 Bot1 casts Grizzly Bears (mana value 2) and Gray Ogre (3) and
# on turn 2 Bot2's two Lightning Bolts kill them. On turn 3 the kicked Healer ({1}{W} twice: Mox Pearl, Plains, Mox Emerald and Mox
# Sapphire, the pool empty right after) asks for a target: Gray Ogre is refused and Grizzly Bears, exactly mana value 2, is taken and
# put onto the battlefield (not into the hand), untapped under Bot1's control. The Ogre and the sacrificed Black Lotus (mana value 0, also a legal target) stay in the graveyard.

